  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.40 “Private dwelling”\n\nRule Env-A 1805.03 titled “Records Maintained On Site” was also deleted by Document #14104.\n\nThe prior filings affecting the deleted definitions and Env-A 1805.03 included the following documents:\n\n#9298, eff 10-21-08 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800)\n\n#12172, eff 5-5-17 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800)\n\nThere were no other filings affecting Chapter Env-A 1800 after Document #12172, effective 5-5-17, until Document #14104. Those rules in the former Env-A 1800 which were not affected by Document #9298 did not expire on 10-21-16 since they were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until replaced",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1800.html"
